# Comment the Selection in the canvas editor: the selected behaviour gets a new
# comment beside the state, the selected part of the name the note n2 (EDIT-TOOL-17)
new-action n0 TIMEOUT [count > 3] / stop()
edit n0 action 0
key end
key left shift
key left shift
key left shift
key left shift
key left shift
key left shift
comment-selection
edit n0 title
key home
key right shift
key right shift
key right shift
key right shift
key right shift
comment-selection n2
